# runs/ layout + naming convention -> runs/README.md (single root; codes/runs retired 2026-06-15).
# Convention: every group's rundirs/ (per-cell config + meta[git/env] + metrics.json + phi.parquet)
# IS tracked — small, immutable, the actual result -> no re-run needed for re-analysis.
# Only transient logs + derived reports are ignored (all regenerated from the rundirs):
runs/phase2_matrix/tier1/
runs/phase2_matrix/tier1_orig/
runs/phase2_matrix/tier2/
runs/phase2_matrix/tier3/
runs/phase2_matrix/smoke/
runs/phase2_matrix/RESULTS.md
runs/phase2_matrix/analysis/

# Track C: Slurm per-job .out logs are transient; the rundirs under runs/track_c/ ARE tracked.
slurm/logs/
# Derived fidelity tables (Spearman+Pearson vs oracle, regenerated from rundir phi):
runs/track_c/fidelity.csv
runs/track_d/fidelity.csv
# Derived (b)-target self-stability tables (Exp C / review C-2; regenerated from rundir phi):
runs/track_d/target_stability.csv
runs/phase2_matrix/target_stability.csv
# Derived cross-seed stability text reports (track_c3.py print capture; regenerated from rundir):
runs/track_c/stability_c1.txt
runs/track_c/stability_c2.txt
# Uniform flat index over ALL rundirs (runs/make_index.py; derived+regenerable — the SCRIPT stays tracked):
runs/_index/
# Track D execution logs (transient; only the rundirs under runs/track_d/rundirs/ are tracked):
runs/track_d/_logs/
# removal_dose orchestration (transient; rundirs/ + rundirs_trackd/ ARE tracked once complete):
runs/removal_dose/_logs/
runs/removal_dose/_sweep/
runs/removal_dose/_sweep_cnn/
runs/removal_dose/_chain/
# beta=0.3 full re-run campaign: per-cell stdout logs are transient (tooling + queue ARE tracked):
runs/rerun_beta03/logs/
# signal-size probe (2026-07-02): transient logs only; rundirs/, noise_probe/, cnn_c*/ ARE tracked:
runs/probe_signal/_logs/
runs/probe_signal/_nohup.out
# corruption x non-IID matrix (2026-07-02): driver+README tracked; logs transient (cells -> phase2_matrix/rundirs):
runs/matrix_cxni/_logs/
runs/matrix_cxni/_nohup.out
